      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:reserved:paragraph:0",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "AWS 保留 IP 地址：并非所有地址都可用",
          "text": "在 AWS IPv4 子网中，前 4 个和最后 1 个 IP 地址不能分配给资源。对于 /24，256 个地址中有 5 个会被保留。",
          "words": 38
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:reserved:paragraph:1",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "AWS 保留 IP 地址：并非所有地址都可用",
          "text": "例如，在 10.0.0.0/24 中，AWS 将 .0 保留给网络，将 .1 保留给 VPC 路由器，将 .2 保留给 DNS，将 .3 保留供将来使用，并将 .255 保留作网络广播。",
          "words": 29
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:reserved:paragraph:2",
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "label": "AWS 保留 IP 地址：并非所有地址都可用",
          "text": "如果只计算所需的 EC2 数量并选择最小范围，地址将不够用。先在所需实例数量上加上 5 个保留地址和扩展余量，再选择允许的 CIDR 范围。",
          "words": 38
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 37,
      "id": "fundamentals.cidr-subnets:section:reserved:concept:1",
      "kind": "reading",
      "label": "AWS 保留 IP 地址：并非所有地址都可用",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "reserved"
      ],
      "sectionId": "reserved",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.cidr-subnets",
      "position": 16,
      "remainingSteps": 23,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:reserved:scenario",
          "kind": "scenario",
          "label": "情景",
          "text": "在一个子网中放置 50 个资源。",
          "words": 10
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:reserved:step:0",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步骤 1",
          "text": "在所需的 50 个地址上加上 5 个预留地址。",
          "words": 8
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:reserved:step:1",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步骤 2",
          "text": "判断 /27 子网中的 32 个地址不够用。",
          "words": 9
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.cidr-subnets:section:reserved:example:1",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "示例",
      "objectiveIds": [
        "reserved"
      ],
      "sectionId": "reserved",
      "sources": [],
      "style": "normal",
      "unitId": "fundamentals.cidr-subnets",
      "position": 17,
      "remainingSteps": 22,
      "totalSteps": 39
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "contentRef": "section:reserved:step:2",
          "kind": "steps",
          "label": "步骤 3",
          "text": "从 /26 的 64 个地址中减去 5 个保留地址，确认还剩 59 个可用地址。",
          "words": 17
        },
        {
          "contentRef": "section:reserved:outcome",
          "kind": "outcome",
          "label": "结论",
          "text": "/26 可以容纳 50 台主机和保留 IP 地址。",
          "words": 13
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 18,
      "id": "fundamentals.cidr-subnets:section:reserved:example:2",
      "kind": "example",
      "label": "示例",
